                                                         ipv6-unicast   1          1          1
instance1   peer0   (default)   established     -        ipv4-unicast   1          1          1
                                                         ipv6-unicast   1          1          1
            peer1   (default)   established     -        ipv4-unicast   1          1          1
                                                         ipv6-unicast   1          1          1
