instance1   peer1-ipv4-PodCIDR                       export   fc00:10:99:8::4                    10.244.0.0/24 (24..24)                              accept       ASPathPrepend: Repeat 2
instance1   peer1-ipv6-PodCIDR                       export   fc00:10:99:8::4                    fd00:10:244::/64 (64..64)                           accept       ASPathPrepend: Repeat 2
